AuraLite-Defrag has NO third-party runtime dependencies. The shipped binaries
link only against the C++20 standard library and operating-system components
provided by Windows (Win32, Direct2D, DirectWrite, WIC, Task Scheduler 2.0 COM,
Storage and Volume IOCTL/FSCTL interfaces). No third-party library code is
compiled into or redistributed with those binaries.

All visual assets, string tables, message identifiers and documentation in this
repository are original clean-room works authored for this project, or are
verified Apache-2.0-compatible dependencies. Every asset is registered with its
author, source, licence and SHA-256 hash in res/assets/asset_register.json and
in sbom.json; the hashes are re-verified on every audit run.

Build-time, QA and packaging tools are not redistributed and are listed in
THIRD-PARTY.md with their licences and written justifications where the licence
is not an open-source licence. The complete component inventory, including
per-file hashes, is in sbom.json.

Corresponding-source and licence questions: see THIRD-PARTY.md and
docs/adr/ADR-009-licence-policy.md.
